/pull/121530.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121530.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-20T16:05:06Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAttempting to use `ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM` on the compatability renderer currently discards the green and blue channels:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1413\" height=\"573\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-07-18 13-17-35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c496a5cf-7211-474e-aae7-e9036f48facb\" />\r\n\r\nAfter applying this patch:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1413\" height=\"573\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-07-18 13-14-05\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6f903ee-e287-46fb-b6a3-ce96da36c03c\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis is due to the attribute binding logic expecting all attributes to be the same size as a float.  I've replicated the above structure for `gl_type`.  \r\n\r\nRegression tested with `ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_FLOAT` which seems to function as before.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://a